SUMMARY:AI for Business: Hands-On Workshop
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**AI for Business: Hands-On Workshop**\n\\
 *\\*\\*Bring your laptop + a paid Anthropic/OpenAI account\\*\\*\\*\n\\*\\
 *Location Change\\*\\*\n\n**Speaker:** [Julio Barros](https://www.linkedin
 .com/in/juliobarros)\n\n**Description:**\nMost business owners have typed 
 a question into ChatGPT. Far fewer have given AI an actual job in their bu
 siness. The gap between “asking AI questions” and “giving AI a job
 ” is the biggest competitive window most of us will see.\n\nIn one eveni
 ng we go from “what is Claude” to a real working setup on your own lap
 top: a project the AI can see\, your business profile loaded into its memo
 ry\, one connector live (Gmail\, Calendar\, Notion\, whichever you use mos
 t)\, and a real task from your week shipped. The task can be a recurring f
 ollow-up email\, a messy folder of receipts\, a report you rebuild every w
 eek\, etc. Anything you’d hand off if you had a junior assistant.\n\nWe
 ’ll cover the same chatbot-to-co-worker progression I walk through in my
  talks\, but instead of watching me demo it\, you’ll work on something i
 mportant to you.\n\nWhat to bring:\n\\* a paid Anthropic or OpenAI account
  ($20 is fine)\n\\* a laptop\n\\* one tedious task you keep redoing\n\nBy 
 the end of the session you’ll have a working project\, at least one skil
 l or scheduled task running\, and a short list of what to automate next\, 
 in what order\, so you don’t automate the wrong thing first.\n\nWho it
 ’s for: business owners\, operators\, and team leads ready to move past 
 “I tried ChatGPT once” and start handing real work off.\n\n**General E
 vent Info**\nAI Hacks and Hops is a monthly event tailored for non-technic
 al professionals\, entrepreneurs\, marketers\, engineers\, or anyone who w
 ants to explore and discuss how to use AI.\n\nEach gathering will feature 
 presentations\, stimulating group discussions\, and a relaxed atmosphere f
 or enjoying your favorite brews while delving into the world of AI. Topics
  will range from AI integration in business processes\, marketing\, conten
 t creation\, software\, ethical considerations\, human-AI collaboration st
 rategies\, to the latest advancements in AI technology. The informal setti
 ng encourages open dialogue\, idea exchange\, and fosters a collaborative 
 spirit.
